@page "/privacy-policy"

<section class="placeholder-card compliance-page">
    <p class="status-label">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>FlatNZ Mobile uses account, flat, finance, and receipt data to help users access their flat and manage shared household activities from the app.</p>

    <div class="status-card compact-status compliance-card">
        <p class="status-label">Data used in the app</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Account data such as name, email address, and authentication session.</li>
            <li>Flat data such as current flat membership, invite codes, join requests, and member roles.</li>
            <li>Shared household data such as chores, shopping items, expenses, settlements, activity log entries, and receipts uploaded by users.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="status-card compact-status compliance-card">
        <p class="status-label">Why FlatNZ uses this data</p>
        <ul>
            <li>To sign users in securely and keep their session active on the device.</li>
            <li>To show the correct flat, members, tasks, finance records, and shared updates.</li>
            <li>To let users upload and review receipts connected to shared expenses.</li>
            <li>To support account, privacy, and deletion requests sent through the support contact.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="status-card compact-status compliance-card">
        <p class="status-label">Support and deletion</p>
        <p>If you need help with privacy questions or want to request account deletion, open the account deletion page or email <strong>support@yobany.top</strong>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="primary-button" href="account-deletion">Account deletion</a>
        <a class="secondary-button" href="settings">Back to settings</a>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .compliance-page {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding-bottom: 7rem;
    }

    .compliance-card p,
    .compliance-card ul {
        margin: 0;
    }

    .compliance-card ul {
        padding-left: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--flat-muted);
        display: grid;
        gap: .45rem;
    }
</style>
